OL,3,GNEWSATeacher barred for life over child
OL,4,Aabuse images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher has been banned from the
OL,7,Fprofession for life after being
OL,8,Fconvicted for downloading and
OL,9,Fpossessing indecent images of children.
OL,11,FChristopher Shepherd, 39, was an
OL,12,FEnglish teacher at E-ACT Willenhall
OL,13,FAcademy, West Midlands, when he was
OL,14,Farrested on 15 January 2025 - four
OL,15,Fmonths after taking the role.
OL,17,FHe pleaded guilty at Cannock
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court in October 2025 to
OL,19,Ftwo counts of making indecent
OL,20,Fphotographs or pseudo-photographs of
OL,21,Fchildren between 24 April 2023 and 15
OL,22,FJanuary 2025 in Wolverhampton.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
